; On the SKILLS line: a person's everyday ask needs the web, and a mind told to use only listed skills took an unlisted
; web-search for a missing permission (tester report 11-13, Create and an imported mind). Policy still drops it when denied.
(SkillContextHint "web" "Web: for anything current or outside what you know (news, weather, prices, versions, a page someone names), web-search query (results with links) | web-fetch https-url (one page's text, with its URL and fetch time to cite).")
(SkillCatalog "Web: web-search query for current external information | web-fetch url to read one https page, with its URL and fetch time to cite")
(SkillHelp "web-search" "web-search query - ask the hive's web search for current information; results give title, URL and snippet")
(SkillHelp "web-fetch" "web-fetch https://example.org/page - the hive fetches one https page and returns its readable text, final URL and fetch time (UTC) to cite")

(SkillHelp "search" "search query - legacy alias for web-search query")
